<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu unit to close Dutch tube plant.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu unit to close Dutch tube plant.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish metals and mining group Outokumpu Oy said in a statement on Friday its JA-RO unit would end tube production at its Dutch subsidiary Finero B.V.'s plants and concentrate output to Finland.</p>
<p>&quot;The plant close will affect a total of 44 people working in production, logistics and quality control,&quot; it said, adding that Finero would continue to operate as a sales company with its current staff of eight people.</p>
<p>The closure would be carried out as soon as possible.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
